ans\">一辆车在正门口的地方停了下来。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1221311\" title=\"Tatoeba · tsayng\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · tsayng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">成立</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せいりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">成立；形成；实现；产生；达成；缔结；同意；批准；完成；制定；安排；成立；有效；适用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145332\"><ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>法<rp>(</rp><rt>ほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>成立<rp>(</rp><rt>せいりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一项新的法律已经出台。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">西暦</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せいれき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公元；基督纪年；公历纪年；西历；格里历</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"531350\"><ruby>昭和<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>１０<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>ねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>西暦<rp>(</rp><rt>せいれき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>１９３５<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>ねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">肖瓦第10年是1935年 在西方的日历。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">背負う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せおう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">背在背上；扛在肩上；承担；负责；承受；以……为背景；置身于……之前；自以为是；自高自大